WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.960
Hello. This is Prepositions with Georgie
from BBC Learning English.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.280
In this video,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:10.080
I'm going to teach you
some prepositions of movement.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.160
These help to indicate how

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.880
something is moving.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.880
But the best way to do this is
by showing you.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.520
Let's get started.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.640
I want to go into my house.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.560
So I walk towards the building,

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.880
and go through
the door.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.600
I walk up the stairs, but I realise I
forgot to close the door.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.880
So I go down the stairs.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.200
Then I go up the stairs again.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.240
And I see some
clothes on the floor.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:51.160
And I think "Shall I jump over the clothes?
Or shall I just walk past the clothes?"

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.840
I decide to
walk past the clothes.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.280
I'm getting a bit hungry, so I
open the fridge,

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:01.080
and a banana
falls out of it.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:03.960
So I pick it up
off the floor.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.640
Then I see a spider,

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.680
so I run away from it.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.960
I then move around the table
for absolutely no reason at all.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:20.320
I go out of the house, across the street,
and walk to the supermarket.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.040
I come out of
the supermarket.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.640
Wow. It's been a busy day.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:30.200
If prepositions scare
you, don't worry.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.120
We'll get through it together.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.600
And in the meantime,

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:37.400
check out the website and download
the worksheet to help you practise.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.920
See you next time.

